<div class="lf-page">
<!-- ═══════════════ PAGE 1: COVER ═══════════════ -->
<div class="lf-cover">
<div class="lf-cover-logo">LF Academy <span style="font-weight:400;color:#C9A84C;font-size:14px;">· LF Academy</span></div>
<div class="lf-cover-grade">小五 · 下學期 · 第 24 堂 · Student Edition Handout</div>
<div class="lf-cover-title">Fraction文字題專項</div>
<div class="lf-cover-subtitle">單元三 · 剩餘問題 ＋ 逆向推理 · 65 min · 1-on-3 Online Lesson</div>
<div class="lf-cover-info">
<b>Textbook Reference：</b>《小學數學新思維（第二版）》5下B冊 單元三綜合 ＋ 現代教育 5下B 單元13<br/>
<b>核心Trap：</b>🪤 T3 FractionDivision文字題錯判運算 · T7「剩下的幾分之幾」誤當「原數的幾分之幾」<br/>
<b>SSPA 關聯：</b><span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 極高頻</span> 呈分試卷一佔約 20%，卷二佔約 15%<br/>
<b>Prerequisites：</b>堂7-8（加減）· 堂9（Multiplication）· 堂22（Division）· 堂23（四則混合）<br/>
<b>Lesson Objectives：</b>❶ 分辨FractionWord Problems的運算類型 ❷「剩下的幾分之幾」Trap辨識 ❸ 多步推理 ❹ 逆向推理（從結果反推原數）
  </div>
<div class="lf-cover-row">
<span>Student Name：<span class="lf-line"></span></span>
<span>Class：<span class="lf-line"></span></span>
<span>Date：<span class="lf-line"></span></span>
<span>Duration：<span class="lf-line"></span></span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- ═══════════════ PAGE 2: WARM-UP + KP1 ═══════════════ -->
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">一、Warm-Up（共 4 題，5 min）</div>

<div class="lf-game"><div class="lf-game-title">🍕 分數大作戰</div><div class="lf-game-desc">通分、約分、四則混合！避開分母陷阱。連續答對分數翻倍！</div><div class="lf-game-action">⚡ 開始挑戰 →</div></div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area（寫出完整計算過程）</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">1</td><td>把「一瓶果汁有 <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> 升，喝了 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> 升」轉成算式。（只需列式，不需計算）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱 基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">2</td><td>「把 <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> 公斤糖果平分給 5 人」——這是什麼運算？列式。</td><td class="qd d1">🌱 基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">3</td><td>「用了全長的 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>」——餘下是全長的幾分之幾？（提示：全長 = 1）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱 基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">4</td><td>「餘下的 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span>」和「原來的 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span>」是否一定相同？舉例說明。</td><td class="qd d2">🌿 進階</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">二、Core Knowledge ＋ Worked Examples</div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點一：一步FractionWord Problems — 辨別運算類型<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
<strong>關鍵詞 → 運算對照表：</strong><br/>
      ① <strong>「一共」「總共」「共」→ Addition</strong>（把不同部分合起來）<br/>
      ② <strong>「餘下」「剩下」「相差」→ Subtraction</strong>（從總數扣去一部分）<br/>
      ③ <strong>「…的幾分之幾」「×倍」→ Multiplication</strong>（求一個數量的幾分之幾）<br/>
      ④ <strong>「平分」「每…一份」「可…多少」→ Division</strong>（平均分配或包含除）
    </div>
</div>
<div class="sc">
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">+</div><div class="t">Addition</div><div class="d">一共、總共<br/>合併、共</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">−</div><div class="t">Subtraction</div><div class="d">餘下、剩下<br/>相差、用了</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">×</div><div class="t">Multiplication</div><div class="d">…的幾分之幾<br/>倍、部分</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">÷</div><div class="t">Division</div><div class="d">平分、每…<br/>可…多少</div></div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題 1 — Addition辨識</div><div class="lf-ex-q">小美有 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span> 盒朱古力，媽媽再買了 <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> 盒。她一共有多少盒朱古力？</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題 2 — Subtraction辨識</div><div class="lf-ex-q">一瓶果汁原有 <span class="f"><span class="n">5</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span> 升，喝了 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> 升。還餘下多少升？</div></div>
<div class="lf-h2">知識點一 同步練習（圈關鍵詞 → 列式 → 計算 → 答句）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">5</td><td>蛋糕店上午賣了 <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> 個蛋糕，下午賣了 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> 個。全日共賣了多少個蛋糕？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">6</td><td>水樽原有水 <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> 升，倒出 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> 升。還餘下多少升？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">7</td><td>一條繩長 <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> 米，用了全長的 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span>。用了多少米？（注意：是「用了全長的½」，不是「用了½米」！）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">8</td><td><span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> 公斤的糖，平分裝入 3 個小袋。每袋有糖多少公斤？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="warn">⚠️ Q7 示範了關鍵Trap：「用了全長的 ½」vs「用了 ½ 米」——前者是Multiplication（求部分），後者是Subtraction（扣去長度）。判斷錯了，整題就錯！</div>
</div>
<!-- ═══════════════ PAGE 3: KP2 ═══════════════ -->
<div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點二：「剩下的幾分之幾」Trap<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA 極高頻殺手題</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
<strong>這是全呈分試最容易錯的題型！</strong><br/>
      ① <strong>「餘下的 a/b」≠「原來的 a/b」</strong> — 必須先求出餘下的量，再取它的幾分之幾<br/>
      ② 解法：先求 <strong>餘下</strong> = 原來 − 已用／已吃／已花<br/>
      ③ 再求 <strong>餘下的幾分之幾</strong> = 餘下 × Fraction<br/>
      ④ <strong>千萬不要直接用原數去乘！</strong>
<div style="margin:10px 0 0;text-align:center;">
<svg style="width:100%;max-width:500px;height:auto;" viewbox="0 0 500 140">
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="250" y="16">「剩下的幾分之幾」Trap圖解</text>
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="10" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="40" y="40">全部</text>
<rect fill="#DBEAFE" height="22" rx="2" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="1.5" width="200" x="10" y="46"></rect>
<rect fill="#FECACA" height="22" rx="2" stroke="#DC2626" stroke-width="1.5" width="66.7" x="10" y="46"></rect>
<text fill="#DC2626" font-size="9" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="43" y="62">用了 1/3</text>
<text fill="#16A34A" font-size="9" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="143" y="42">剩餘 2/3</text>
<text fill="#6B7280" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle" x="110" y="82">↓</text>
<text fill="#16A34A" font-size="10" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="40" y="100">剩餘</text>
<rect fill="#BBF7D0" height="22" rx="2" stroke="#16A34A" stroke-width="1.5" width="133.3" x="76" y="88"></rect>
<rect fill="#FECACA" height="22" rx="2" stroke="#DC2626" stroke-width="1.5" width="66.7" x="76" y="88"></rect>
<text fill="#DC2626" font-size="9" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="110" y="104">再用剩餘的 1/2</text>
<text fill="#16A34A" font-size="9" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="176" y="104">仍有</text>
<rect fill="#FEF2F2" height="40" rx="5" stroke="#FECACA" stroke-width="1.5" width="220" x="270" y="38"></rect>
<text fill="#DC2626" font-size="10" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="380" y="54">❌ 錯：直接 1/3 + 1/2 = 5/6</text>
<text fill="#991B1B" font-size="9" text-anchor="middle" x="380" y="68">把「剩餘的1/2」當成「全部的1/2」</text>
<rect fill="#F0FDF4" height="40" rx="5" stroke="#BBF7D0" stroke-width="1.5" width="220" x="270" y="85"></rect>
<text fill="#16A34A" font-size="10" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="380" y="101">✅ 對：剩餘×1/2 = 2/3×1/2 = 1/3</text>
<text fill="#14532D" font-size="9" text-anchor="middle" x="380" y="115">「剩餘的」要先算剩餘量再乘！</text>
</svg>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex">
<div class="lf-ex-title">🪤 Trap引爆例題 3（本堂最重要的示範！）</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q">一條絲帶長 <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> 米，用了 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> 米後，把餘下的 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span> 用來包禮物。包禮物用了多少米？</div>
<div class="lf-ex-compare">
<div class="lf-ex-wrong"><div class="lf-ex-label">❌ 致命錯誤（80% 學生）</div><div class="eq"><span class="fd"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> × <span class="fd"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span> = <span class="fd"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span> 米</div><div class="why">直接把「餘下的½」當成「原絲帶的½」來計算！</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex-right"><div class="lf-ex-label">✅ 正確解法</div><div class="eq">餘下 = <span class="fd"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> − <span class="fd"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> = <span class="fd"><span class="n">5</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">12</span></span> → 包禮物 = <span class="fd"><span class="n">5</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">12</span></span> × <span class="fd"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span> = <span class="fd"><span class="n">5</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">24</span></span> 米</div><div class="why">必須先求餘下，再取餘下的½（不是原絲帶的½！）</div></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="mn">🧠 Mnemonic：「見『餘下』先減後乘——先減出餘數，再乘Fraction。『餘下的』三字要圈起來，警惕自己不要直接乘原數！」</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題 4 — Multiplication型「剩下的幾分之幾」</div><div class="lf-ex-q">小明有零用錢 <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span>，花了 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> 後，把餘下的 <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> 儲蓄。儲蓄了多少？（以帶Fraction作答）</div></div>
<div class="lf-h2">知識點二 同步練習（圈「餘下的」→先求餘下→再取Fraction→答句）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">9</td><td>一瓶橙汁 <span class="f"><span class="n">7</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span> 升，喝了 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> 升。餘下的 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> 用來做果凍。做果凍用了多少升？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:78px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">10</td><td>一包糖重 <span class="f"><span class="n">4</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> 公斤，用去 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> 公斤後，餘下的 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span> 用來做蛋糕。做蛋糕用了多少公斤？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:78px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">11</td><td>一條繩長 <span class="f"><span class="n">5</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span> 米，先剪去 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> 米，餘下的 <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> 用來做繩結。做繩結用了多少米？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">12</td><td>一盒果汁 <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> 升，喝了 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span> 升。再把餘下的平分給 3 個朋友。每人分得多少升？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">13</td><td>姊姊有朱古力 <span class="f"><span class="n">5</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span> 盒，吃了 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> 盒後，餘下的 <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> 給了弟弟。弟弟得到多少盒？（注意：題中有兩個Trap——先減後乘！）</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:82px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="warn">⚠️ 第二大Trap：「餘下的平分」=先減（求餘下），再除（平分）。不是先除後減！次序錯了答案完全不同。</div>
</div>
<!-- ═══════════════ PAGE 4: KP3 ═══════════════ -->
<div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點三：多步推理文字題<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA 進階必考</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
<strong>一個Question含兩個或以上運算步驟，需要按正確次序執行：</strong><br/>
      ① <strong>圈出所有關鍵數據</strong>（數量、Fraction、關係詞）<br/>
      ② <strong>畫流程箭咀</strong>：原來 → 第一步（＋−×÷）→ 中間結果 → 第二步（＋−×÷）→ 答案<br/>
      ③ <strong>列綜合算式</strong>（有需要時加括號）<br/>
      ④ <strong>逐步計算</strong>，每步核對是否合理（例如餘下不能大於原來）
    </div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題 5 — 加減混合</div><div class="lf-ex-q">水桶原有水 <span class="f"><span class="n">5</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span> 升，用了 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> 升後，再加入 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span> 升。現在有水多少升？（需先減後加）</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題 6 — 乘除混合</div><div class="lf-ex-q">一條繩長 <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> 米，用了全長的 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> 後，把餘下的平分為 3 段。每段長多少米？</div></div>
<div class="lf-h2">知識點三 同步練習（畫流程 → 列式 → 逐步計算 → 答句）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">14</td><td>一瓶果汁 <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> 升，上午喝了 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> 升，下午再加入 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span> 升。現在總共有多少升？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:78px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">15</td><td>一盒蛋糕重 <span class="f"><span class="n">5</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span> 公斤。切去 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> 公斤後，把餘下的平分給 3 人。每人分得多少公斤？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:82px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">16</td><td>小華有 <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> 升水，小明有 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> 升水的 2 倍。他們一共有水多少升？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:82px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">17</td><td>一條繩長 1<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span> 米，用了全長的 <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> 後，將餘下的 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> 用來做裝飾。做裝飾用了多少米？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點四：逆向推理文字題<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA 殺手題</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
<strong>從結果反推原來數量——呈分試卷二的拉分題！</strong><br/>
      ① <strong>識別</strong>：Question給出「最後結果」，要你求「原來有多少」<br/>
      ② <strong>策略</strong>：從最後結果 <strong>逆向操作</strong>（加變減、減變加、乘變除、除變乘）<br/>
      ③ <strong>Mnemonic</strong>：順向列式，逆向解題 —— 把順向的每一步反過來做<br/>
      ④ <strong>驗算</strong>：用求出的原數，順向計算一次，應該等於Question給出的結果
    </div>
</div>
<div class="sc">
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">→</div><div class="t">順向思考</div><div class="d">原來 → 減去<br/>→ 餘下 → ×Fraction</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">←</div><div class="t">逆向操作</div><div class="d">從結果反推<br/>÷變×、＋變−</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">✓</div><div class="t">驗算</div><div class="d">用原數順向<br/>計算確認</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">⚠</div><div class="t">Trap</div><div class="d">注意單位<br/>和Fraction類型</div></div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題 7 — 逆向推理（Subtraction逆向）</div><div class="lf-ex-q">小明有一些朱古力，吃了 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> 盒後，餘下 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span> 盒。原來有多少盒朱古力？</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題 8 — 逆向推理（混合逆向）</div><div class="lf-ex-q">一條繩子，先剪去 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> 米，再將餘下的 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span> 用來做手工，做手工用了 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> 米。原來繩長多少米？</div></div>
<div class="lf-h2">知識點四 同步練習</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">18</td><td>一瓶果汁，喝去 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> 升後，餘下 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> 升。原來有多少升？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">19</td><td>一些糖果，平分給 4 人後，每人得 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span> 公斤。原來有糖果多少公斤？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">20</td><td>一盒蛋糕，吃了 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span> 盒，再吃了 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> 盒，餘下 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span> 盒。原來有多少盒蛋糕？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:82px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="mn">🧠 Mnemonic（逆向推理）：「從尾到頭倒著算，加變減來乘變除，減變加來除變乘，算完記得驗一驗。」</div>
</div>
